# Local IPOs: no company goes public while the city's Stock Exchange is below level 2. The cards
# with a slot open say so; at level 2 they say what they said before. The level is only what this
# scenario's IPOs see: the city's own Stock Exchange is untouched (both are logged).
name local ipos: below Stock Exchange level 2 the cards say it must grow; at level 2 they do not
local-ipos on
ipo-scan
ipo-exchange-level 1
show-economy
wait 1.5
expect-company-cards
expect-exchange-note on
scroll-bottom InvestmentsScrollablePanel
wait 0.5
capture ipo-exchange-gate
ipo-exchange-level 0
wait 1.5
expect-exchange-note on
ipo-exchange-level 2
wait 1.5
expect-exchange-note off
cleanup:
close-economy
ipo-exchange-level real
local-ipos restore
